column3:
Waters has two verified Twitter accounts.
@RepMaxineWaters is her account for her work as a representative , and it features the same user photo as the account featured in the Facebook post.
@MaxineWaters is her account for her congressional campaigns .
We searched both accounts for the words in the Facebook post and came up empty.
But back in 2018, Snopes fact-checked another such tweet from the account that was fooling people.
@RepMaxineWaters is her account for her work as a representative , and it features the same user photo as the account featured in the Facebook post.
@MaxineWaters is her account for her congressional campaigns .
We searched both accounts for the words in the Facebook post and came up empty.
@MaxinePWaters, the account in the Facebook post , has been suspended for violating Twitter’s rules.
